   - implicit_return
   - multiline_function_chains
   - multiline_parameters
   - multiline_arguments
   - prefer_self_in_static_references
   - unneeded_parentheses_in_closure_argument

5. Disabled rules not blocking quality:
   - large_tuple (SwiftUI state management uses 3+ tuples)
   - identifier_name (SwiftUI ViewBuilders start with capitals)

6. **CRITICAL DISCOVERY:** 51 force-unwraps in production code
   - Downgraded force_unwrapping to warning temporarily
   - Will fix incrementally in Track 3
   - Tests excluded (Apple pattern allows ! in assertions)

