**Critical Issues (6 categories):**
1. Dependency & State Fixes (HIGH PRIORITY - 3 hours)
   - WeightTrackingViewModel creates internal WeightManager()
   - Defeats thread-safety architecture
   - Fix: Inject via @EnvironmentObject

